# Signing keys for this tree
#
# Generated by ../../../gen-keys.sh. Every certificate here is self-signed and
# lives under vendor/lineage-priv/, which is not tracked by any upstream repo,
# so `repo sync` never overwrites it.
#
# Why the whole set sits in one directory: Soong resolves every named
# certificate relative to the *directory* of PRODUCT_DEFAULT_DEV_CERTIFICATE
# (build/soong/android/config.go:DefaultAppCertificateDir). Modules declared
# with `certificate: "platform"`, "shared", "media", "networkstack",
# "bluetooth", "nfc", "sdk_sandbox" or "cts_uicc_2021" therefore pick up the
# matching <name>.x509.pem / <name>.pk8 from here instead of falling back to
# AOSP test-keys.
#
# AVB: avb.pem / avb_pkmd.bin are NOT referenced from makefiles. BoardConfig
# variables cannot be set from a product makefile, so a hardware target has to
# opt in itself — see README.md in this directory.

PRODUCT_DEFAULT_DEV_CERTIFICATE := vendor/lineage-priv/keys/releasekey
PRODUCT_OTA_PUBLIC_KEYS := vendor/lineage-priv/keys/releasekey
PRODUCT_EXTRA_RECOVERY_KEYS := vendor/lineage-priv/keys/releasekey

# Bluetooth 蓝牙栈（com.android.bt APEX 内的 Bluetooth.apk）用 certificate: "bluetooth"
# 签名（即本目录的 bluetooth.x509.pem），而 sepolicy 的 mac_permissions.xml 里
# @BLUETOOTH 占位符默认从 AOSP 测试密钥目录取证书（build/make/core/config.mk：
# 只有 PRODUCT_PACKAGES 含 com.google.android.bt 时才回落到 DEFAULT 证书目录，
# 否则用 build/make/target/product/security/）。两边证书不一致 → 匹配不到
# signer → seinfo 变成 default → seapp_contexts 的 user=bluetooth seinfo=bluetooth
# 条目永远匹配不上 → selinux_android_setcontext 失败 → 蓝牙每 30 秒 FC。
# 一行修好：把 @BLUETOOTH 的证书目录指回本目录。
PRODUCT_MAINLINE_BLUETOOTH_SEPOLICY_DEV_CERTIFICATES := vendor/lineage-priv/keys
